  "legalTermsBody2": "You must be at least 18, or the age of majority where you live, to register. Give accurate details and keep your login private. You are responsible for everything that happens on your account. One person, one account.",
  "legalTermsTitle3": "Points and rewards",
  "legalTermsBody3": "Points are a loyalty feature, not currency. They have no cash value outside the app, cannot be purchased, and cannot be moved to another account. Rewards in the Shop may change, sell out or have their own conditions. We may expire points after 12 months of account inactivity and will tell you before that happens.",
  "legalTermsTitle4": "Fair play",
  "legalTermsBody4": "Do not use cheats, scripts, emulators, exploits or bots, and do not manipulate games, quests or referrals. If we find unfair play we may remove the points involved, limit features or close the account. You can appeal any decision through Support.",
  "legalTermsTitle5": "Games from partners",
  "legalTermsBody5": "Many games are made by other studios. Their own terms and rules apply while you play them, and they are responsible for their games. Points shown on a game card are paid by P2E, not by the studio.",
  "legalTermsTitle6": "Purchases",
  "legalTermsBody6": "Some games offer optional in-app purchases. Purchases are handled by the app store you use and follow its refund rules. Buying anything is never required to earn points.",
  "legalTermsTitle7": "Ending the agreement",
  "legalTermsBody7": "You can delete your account at any time in Settings. Unredeemed points are lost when the account is deleted. We may suspend or close accounts that break these Terms.",
  "legalTermsTitle8": "Liability",
  "legalTermsBody8": "The app is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect losses or for outages outside our control. Nothing here limits rights you have under consumer law.",
  "legalTermsTitle9": "Changes",
  "legalTermsBody9": "If we change these Terms in a way that matters, we will let you know in the app at least 14 days before the change takes effect.",
  "legalTermsEnd": "Questions about this agreement? Contact Support from the Help menu in the app.",
  "legalPrivacyPoint1": "We collect only what we need to run your account, track your points and keep play fair.",
  "legalPrivacyPoint2": "We never sell your personal data.",
  "legalPrivacyPoint3": "Partner studios receive anonymous gameplay events, not your name, email or phone number.",
  "legalPrivacyPoint4": "You can download or delete your data at any time from Settings.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle1": "What we collect",
  "legalPrivacyBody1": "Account details you give us: email or phone number, username and avatar. Gameplay data: which games you play, for how long, quests completed and points earned. Device data: device model, OS version, app version and a device identifier used for fraud checks.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle2": "Why we use it",
  "legalPrivacyBody2": "To run your account and wallet, credit points and deliver rewards, prevent cheating and multiple accounts, send notifications you turned on, and improve the app. We rely on our contract with you, our legitimate interest in fair play, and your consent where the law requires it.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle3": "Who we share it with",
  "legalPrivacyBody3": "Service providers that host data, send codes and deliver rewards, under contracts that bind them to protect it. Partner studios, which receive anonymous gameplay events only. Authorities, when the law requires it. We do not sell personal data and we do not share it for third-party advertising.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle4": "How long we keep it",
  "legalPrivacyBody4": "While your account is active. After you delete your account we remove personal data within 30 days, except records we must keep by law, such as reward transactions, which are kept for up to 5 years.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle5": "Your rights",
  "legalPrivacyBody5": "You can access, correct, download or delete your data, object to some uses, and withdraw consent at any time. Most of this is in Settings, Privacy. For anything else contact Support and we reply within 30 days.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle6": "Security",
  "legalPrivacyBody6": "Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, access is limited to staff who need it, and we test our systems regularly. If a breach affects you, we will tell you without undue delay.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle7": "Children",
  "legalPrivacyBody7": "The app is not meant for anyone under 18. If we learn that a minor has created an account, we close it and delete the data.",
  "legalPrivacyTitle8": "Changes",
  "legalPrivacyBody8": "We will tell you in the app before any important change to this policy takes effect.",
  "legalPrivacyEnd": "Questions about this policy? Contact Support from the Help menu in the app.",
  "legalTermsBody": "These Terms are an agreement between you and P2E. You must be at least 18. Points are a loyalty feature, not currency. Do not cheat. You can delete your account in Settings.",
  "legalPrivacyBody": "We collect the email or phone number, username and avatar you give us, plus gameplay and device data used to keep play fair. You can download or delete your data from Settings.",
